# 🍼 Baby App — Design System Rules

## Color Tokens

Always use these CSS variables. Never hardcode hex values.

```css
:root {
  /* Primary — Pembe */
  --color-primary:        #D63B7A;
  --color-primary-light:  #F06292;
  --color-primary-pale:   #FCE4EC;

  /* Secondary — Bebek Mavisi */
  --color-secondary:      #4FC3F7;
  --color-secondary-light:#E1F5FE;
  --color-secondary-dark: #0288D1;

  /* Neutrals */
  --color-white:          #FFFFFF;
  --color-surface:        #FFF8FA;
  --color-card:           #FFFFFF;
  --color-border:         #F3C6D8;

  /* Text */
  --color-text-primary:   #2C1A2E;
  --color-text-secondary: #7B5E6E;
  --color-text-muted:     #B39DAA;
  --color-text-on-primary:#FFFFFF;

  /* Status */
  --color-success: #66BB6A;
  --color-warning: #FFA726;
  --color-error:   #EF5350;
  --color-info:    #29B6F6;
}
```

## Typography

Use **Nunito** for headings/numbers, **Poppins** for body/labels. Import from Google Fonts.

```css
@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Nunito:wght@400;600;700;800&family=Poppins:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap');

:root {
  --font-heading: 'Nunito', sans-serif;
  --font-body:    'Poppins', sans-serif;

  --text-xs:   11px;
  --text-sm:   13px;
  --text-base: 15px;
  --text-md:   17px;
  --text-lg:   20px;
  --text-xl:   24px;
  --text-2xl:  30px;

  --weight-regular:   400;
  --weight-medium:    500;
  --weight-semibold:  600;
  --weight-bold:      700;
  --weight-extrabold: 800;
}
```

| Element          | Font    | Size          | Weight    |
|---|---|---|-----|
| Page Title (H1)  | Nunito  | `--text-2xl`  | 800       |
| Card Title (H2)  | Nunito  | `--text-xl`   | 700       |
| Section (H3)     | Nunito  | `--text-lg`   | 600       |
| Body text        | Poppins | `--text-base` | 400       |
| Label / Caption  | Poppins | `--text-sm`   | 500       |
| Button text      | Poppins | `--text-base` | 600       |
| Stat numbers     | Nunito  | `--text-2xl`  | 800       |

## Spacing & Shape

```css
:root {
  --space-1:  4px;  --space-2:  8px;  --space-3:  12px;
  --space-4:  16px; --space-5:  20px; --space-6:  24px;
  --space-8:  32px; --space-10: 40px; --space-12: 48px;

  --radius-sm:   8px;
  --radius-md:   14px;
  --radius-lg:   20px;
  --radius-xl:   28px;
  --radius-full: 9999px;

  --shadow-card:   0 4px 16px rgba(214, 59, 122, 0.10);
  --shadow-button: 0 4px 12px rgba(214, 59, 122, 0.30);
  --shadow-modal:  0 8px 32px rgba(44, 26, 46, 0.18);
  --shadow-soft:   0 2px 8px  rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
}
```

## Component Patterns

### Card
```css
.card {
  background: var(--color-card);
  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  padding: var(--space-5) var(--space-6);
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
  border: 1.5px solid var(--color-border);
}
```

### Primary Button
```css
.btn-primary {
  background: var(--color-primary);
  color: var(--color-text-on-primary);
  border-radius: var(--radius-full);
  padding: var(--space-3) var(--space-8);
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: var(--text-base);
  font-weight: var(--weight-semibold);
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-button);
  border: none;
  transition: transform 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease;
}
.btn-primary:hover {
  transform: translateY(-2px);
  box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(214, 59, 122, 0.38);
}
```

### Secondary Button
```css
.btn-secondary {
  background: transparent;
  color: var(--color-primary);
  border: 2px solid var(--color-primary);
  border-radius: var(--radius-full);
  padding: var(--space-3) var(--space-8);
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-weight: var(--weight-semibold);
}
```

### Ghost Button
```css
.btn-ghost {
  background: var(--color-primary-pale);
  color: var(--color-primary);
  border: none;
  border-radius: var(--radius-full);
  padding: var(--space-2) var(--space-5);
}
```

### App Header
```css
.app-header {
  background: var(--color-primary);
  color: var(--color-text-on-primary);
  padding: var(--space-4) var(--space-5);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: var(--weight-bold);
  font-size: var(--text-md);
}
```

### 2-Column Menu Grid (Ana Ekran)
```css
.menu-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
  gap: var(--space-4);
  padding: var(--space-5);
}

.menu-item {
  background: var(--color-primary-pale);
  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  padding: var(--space-6) var(--space-4);
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  gap: var(--space-3);
  color: var(--color-primary);
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: var(--text-sm);
  font-weight: var(--weight-semibold);
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
  border: 1.5px solid var(--color-border);
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: transform 0.15s ease;
}
.menu-item:hover  { transform: scale(1.03); }
.menu-item:active { transform: scale(0.97); }
.menu-item .icon  { width: 32px; height: 32px; color: var(--color-primary); }
```

### Stat Ring (Hafta / Gün Sayacı)
```css
.stat-ring {
  background: var(--color-card);
  border: 3px solid var(--color-primary);
  border-radius: var(--radius-full);
  width: 110px;
  height: 110px;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
}
.stat-ring__number {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-size: var(--text-2xl);
  font-weight: var(--weight-extrabold);
  color: var(--color-primary);
  line-height: 1.2;
}
.stat-ring__label {
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: var(--text-xs);
  font-weight: var(--weight-medium);
  color: var(--color-text-secondary);
}
```

### Info Chip
```css
.info-chip {
  background: var(--color-primary-pale);
  border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  padding: var(--space-3) var(--space-4);
  font-size: var(--text-sm);
  color: var(--color-text-secondary);
}
.info-chip__value {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-size: var(--text-md);
  font-weight: var(--weight-bold);
  color: var(--color-primary);
}
```

### Blog Card
```css
.blog-card {
  background: var(--color-card);
  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  overflow: hidden;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
  border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
}
.blog-card__category {
  font-size: var(--text-xs);
  font-weight: var(--weight-semibold);
  color: var(--color-primary);
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.06em;
}
.blog-card__title {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-size: var(--text-md);
  font-weight: var(--weight-bold);
  color: var(--color-text-primary);
  line-height: 1.2;
}
```

### Input Field
```css
.input {
  background: var(--color-surface);
  border: 2px solid var(--color-border);
  border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  padding: var(--space-3) var(--space-4);
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: var(--text-base);
  color: var(--color-text-primary);
  width: 100%;
  transition: border-color 0.2s ease;
  outline: none;
}
.input:focus {
  border-color: var(--color-primary);
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(214, 59, 122, 0.12);
}
```

### Tag / Chip
```css
.chip {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: var(--space-1);
  background: var(--color-secondary-light);
  color: var(--color-secondary-dark);
  border-radius: var(--radius-full);
  padding: var(--space-1) var(--space-3);
  font-size: var(--text-xs);
  font-weight: var(--weight-semibold);
}
.chip--pink {
  background: var(--color-primary-pale);
  color: var(--color-primary);
}
```

## Iconography

- Size: small `20px` / medium `28px` / large `36px`
- Style: **outline** (not filled)
- Color: `var(--color-primary)` or `var(--color-secondary)`
- Library: `lucide-react` or `heroicons`
- Always pair icons with a text label in menus

## Mobile Breakpoints

```css
/* Mobile first — default is mobile */
@media (min-width: 480px)  { /* sm */ }
@media (min-width: 768px)  { /* md */ }
@media (min-width: 1024px) { /* lg */ }
```

## ✅ DO

- Use `--color-primary` (pink) as the dominant color
- Use `--color-secondary` (baby blue) as accent only
- Always use `--radius-lg` or `--radius-full` — no sharp corners
- Add `box-shadow: var(--shadow-button)` to primary buttons
- Use `--color-surface` (`#FFF8FA`) as page background — never plain white
- Use Nunito for all numbers and headings
- Keep animations subtle: `transition: 0.15s ease` only

## ❌ DON'T

- Never hardcode hex colors — always use CSS variables
- Never use `border-radius: 0` or sharp corners anywhere
- Never use system fonts (Arial, sans-serif, Roboto)
- Never use dark backgrounds — this is a light-mode only app
- Never use oversaturated candy pink (`#FF69B4`) — use `--color-primary`
- Never use purple gradients or generic AI aesthetics
- Never add complex animations — keep it soft and calm design-system frontend
